[ti:Great Again]
[ar:Mippithedork]
[offset:-300]

[00:00.00]I PLAY GAMES!
[00:02.99]I KNOW GAMES!
[00:05.69]I've been gaming since I learned to walk!
[00:08.34]So shut your mouth and let me talk!
[00:13.42]I've beaten every Souls game,
[00:14.77]Got a thousand hours in
[00:15.78]I know exactly what's been wrong
[00:17.22]With everything you've built
[00:18.15]You went to school, you worked for years,
[00:19.38]You climbed the corporate chain
[00:20.64]But I was on the front lines, man,
[00:21.78]I actually played the games!
[00:22.98]You tell me "Start with something small"
[00:24.85]I tell you "THINK BIG OR DON'T THINK AT ALL!"
[00:27.56]You say "Scope down, make a plan"
[00:29.74]I say "YOU JUST DON'T UNDERSTAND!"
[00:32.79]You got your pipelines, got your rules
[00:35.08]Got your fancy industry tools
[00:37.37]But I got something you forgot
[00:39.69]A PASSION THAT YOU HAVEN'T GOT!
[00:42.04]I PLAY GAMES!
[00:43.53]I KNOW GAMES!
[00:44.78]YOU'RE THE REASON THEY'RE ALL THE SAME!
[00:46.94]YOU SOLD OUT!
[00:48.14]I WON'T BEND!
[00:49.51]I'M THE PLAYER WHO'S GONNA MAKE 'EM GREAT AGAIN!
[00:52.11]No deadlines!
[00:53.32]No compromise!
[00:54.54]Just a million-dollar dream in my eyes!
[00:56.55]You had your turn, now step aside!
[00:58.96]I'LL SHOW YOU HOW TO MAKE A GAME DONE RIGHT!
[01:04.37]Some old dev said "Learn to code"
[01:06.17]I said "AI CAN DO THAT, BRO!"
[01:08.87]He said "Who's gonna fix it when it breaks?"
[01:10.89]I said "MAN, YOU PEOPLE LOVE TO HATE!"
[01:13.85]They said "Design is more than ideas"
[01:15.91]Well, I've got twenty thousand of 'em here!
[01:18.28]They said "Prototypes can prove what's fun"
[01:20.59]I said "I ALREADY KNOW! I'M THE ONE WHO PLAYS 'EM!"
[01:24.08]And every time I post my plans
[01:25.99]There's another vet who thinks he understands
[01:28.44]"Try a game jam," "Build a loop"
[01:30.81]JUST MORE GATEKEEPING FROM YOUR CORPORATE GROUP!
[01:33.37]You got experience, I got heart
[01:35.49]You tear my masterpiece apart
[01:37.87]Before I've even made a thing
[01:40.07]YOU'RE JUST AFRAID OF WHAT I'LL BRING!
[01:42.41]I PLAY GAMES!
[01:44.08]I KNOW GAMES!
[01:45.33]YOU'RE THE REASON THEY'RE ALL THE SAME!
[01:47.56]YOU SOLD OUT!
[01:48.81]I WON'T BEND!
[01:50.18]I'M THE PLAYER WHO'S GONNA MAKE 'EM GREAT AGAIN!
[01:52.78]No deadlines!
[01:53.89]No compromise!
[01:55.16]Just a million-dollar dream in my eyes!
[01:57.08]You had your turn, now step aside!
[01:59.46]I'LL SHOW YOU HOW TO MAKE A GAME DONE RIGHT!
[02:04.57]They say "Who's your programmer?"
[02:06.76]I say "I'll figure it out!"
[02:09.38]They say "Who's doing animation?"
[02:11.53]I say "STOP COUNTING ME OUT!"
[02:13.96]They say "Have you opened the engine?"
[02:16.50]I say "I've watched the guides!"
[02:19.00]They say "Have you made a prototype?"
[02:21.34]I say "I DON'T NEED TO TRY!"
[02:24.78]TEN THOUSAND HOURS!
[02:26.24]WITH A CONTROLLER IN MY HAND!
[02:28.86]THAT'S TEN THOUSAND HOURS!
[02:31.25]MORE THAN YOU COULD UNDERSTAND!
[02:33.68]YOU CALL IT EXPERIENCE!
[02:36.08]I CALL IT FEAR!
[02:38.51]THE FUTURE OF GAMING
[02:40.88]IS FINALLY HERE!
[02:43.45]I PLAY GAMES!
[02:44.81]I KNOW GAMES!
[02:46.12]YOU'RE THE REASON THEY'RE ALL THE SAME!
[02:48.25]YOU SOLD OUT!
[02:49.50]I WON'T BEND!
[02:50.87]I'M THE PLAYER WHO'S GONNA MAKE 'EM GREAT AGAIN!
[02:53.64]No budget! No team!
[02:55.84]NO LIMIT TO MY DREAM!
[02:58.02]You had your turn, now step aside!
[03:00.12]I'LL SHOW YOU HOW TO MAKE A GAME DONE RIGHT!
[03:05.51]And when my game comes out
[03:08.00]You'll all be eating crow
[03:10.17]The greatest game you've ever played
[03:12.57]From the greatest dev you'll ever know!
[03:16.91]...Hey, does anybody know how to add a jump button?
[03:20.68]JUST GOOGLE IT!
[03:21.94]HEY! HEY! HEY! HEY! HEY! HEY!
